1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:01,600
[DOOR OPENS]

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:03,667
[KEYS JINGLING]

3
00:00:03,667 --> 00:00:05,233
- [SCREAMS IN FEAR] Ah!
- [SILLY SFX]

4
00:00:07,467 --> 00:00:09,167
Sweetie!

5
00:00:09,600 --> 00:00:11,500
Isn't it beautiful?

6
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:15,433
I had it made so we can sell
our vinegar better

7
00:00:15,433 --> 00:00:17,533
because of your beautiful face!

8
00:00:17,533 --> 00:00:19,700
- How much did you spend?
- Nah, it's free

9
00:00:19,700 --> 00:00:23,100
because your Uncle Dennis
used that as his payment to me.

10
00:00:23,100 --> 00:00:25,667
[QUIRKY MUSIC PLAYING]

11
00:00:25,667 --> 00:00:28,533
I picked it up myself
since I was going here anyway.

12
00:00:29,700 --> 00:00:31,100
How much do you need?

13
00:00:32,400 --> 00:00:33,767
Oh, wow.

14
00:00:33,800 --> 00:00:36,367
Do you think borrowing money
is all I know?

15
00:00:37,033 --> 00:00:39,567
Well, since we're already
on that topic,

16
00:00:39,567 --> 00:00:41,567
can I borrow 500 pesos
to get my teeth checked?

17
00:00:42,167 --> 00:00:43,433
500 pesos?!

18
00:00:43,733 --> 00:00:46,467
But, we were supposed to use it
to pay rent

19
00:00:46,467 --> 00:00:48,400
plus we still have some debts...

20
00:00:48,600 --> 00:00:50,367
You should share your blessings!

21
00:00:50,367 --> 00:00:51,467
[JUNE CLICKS TONGUE]

22
00:00:52,400 --> 00:00:53,767
[CLICKS TONGUE]

23
00:00:57,067 --> 00:00:58,700
[JUNE MUTTERING
UNDER HER BREATH]

24
00:00:58,700 --> 00:01:00,000
[PHONE BEEPS]

25
00:01:00,200 --> 00:01:01,500
- Score!
- Hmm.

26
00:01:01,500 --> 00:01:03,133
- Thanks!
- Yeah, yeah.

27
00:01:03,133 --> 00:01:05,133
- I'll get going now.
- You should've gone earlier.

28
00:01:05,800 --> 00:01:07,800
[DOOR CLOSES]

29
00:01:07,833 --> 00:01:10,067
Oh, and...

30
00:01:10,067 --> 00:01:11,767
the electric bill...

31
00:01:12,267 --> 00:01:14,167
just arrived.

32
00:01:14,167 --> 00:01:15,500
[SILLY SFX]

33
00:01:15,500 --> 00:01:21,600
[SOMBER MUSIC PLAYING]

34
00:01:21,600 --> 00:01:23,167
[SIGHS]

35
00:01:23,500 --> 00:01:25,167
[IMA] Dear, I know
you're exhausted

36
00:01:25,167 --> 00:01:26,800
from job hunting.

37
00:01:27,233 --> 00:01:29,533
But don't worry,
it'll all work out soon.

38
00:01:30,367 --> 00:01:32,200
[KNOCKING ON DOOR]

39
00:01:32,200 --> 00:01:34,167
Is 500 pesos not enough
for you?!

40
00:01:34,167 --> 00:01:36,367
He's crazy! Why'd he come back?

41
00:01:36,367 --> 00:01:38,400
He's absolutely shameless!

42
00:01:39,267 --> 00:01:40,600
[DOOR CREAKS OPEN]

43
00:01:41,500 --> 00:01:43,567
[WHISPERS] Huh? Who is it?

44
00:01:44,367 --> 00:01:46,200
[DOOR OPENS]

45
00:01:46,200 --> 00:01:48,767
[ETHEREAL MUSIC PLAYS]

46
00:01:48,767 --> 00:01:51,233
Hello! My name
is Attorney Zia Sun,

47
00:01:51,233 --> 00:01:53,567
the family lawyer
of Don Nato Rose.

48
00:01:54,567 --> 00:01:59,233
Oh, isn't he the one on the news
whose yacht caught fire?

49
00:01:59,433 --> 00:02:01,667
Did anyone survive
from the incident?

50
00:02:01,667 --> 00:02:04,733
Actually, an heir survived.

51
00:02:05,533 --> 00:02:06,767
Did you know...

52
00:02:06,767 --> 00:02:08,667
that your father is the cousin
of the cousin of the uncle

53
00:02:08,667 --> 00:02:12,800
of the nephew of the cousin's
cousin of Don Nato?

54
00:02:12,800 --> 00:02:13,767
[SILLY SFX]

55
00:02:14,233 --> 00:02:15,200
What?!

56
00:02:15,733 --> 00:02:17,133
Can you please...

57
00:02:17,733 --> 00:02:19,467
- run it back from the top?
- Ah!

58
00:02:20,833 --> 00:02:22,267
- [DOOR CLOSES]
- Why did she close--

59
00:02:22,267 --> 00:02:23,800
[KNOCKING ON DOOR]

60
00:02:23,800 --> 00:02:25,433
[DOOR OPENS]

61
00:02:25,433 --> 00:02:27,767
Hello! My name
is Attorney Zia Sun,

62
00:02:27,767 --> 00:02:30,267
the family lawyer
of Don Nato Rose.

63
00:02:30,267 --> 00:02:31,733
Did you know that your father
is the cousin of the cousin

64
00:02:31,733 --> 00:02:34,200
of the uncle of the nephew
of the cousin's cousin

65
00:02:34,200 --> 00:02:36,767
of the cousin of Don Nato?

66
00:02:36,767 --> 00:02:38,300
[CRICKETS SFX]

67
00:02:38,300 --> 00:02:41,300
In other words, you,
June Sampaga,

68
00:02:41,300 --> 00:02:44,500
are the heir of the Rose
family empire.

69
00:02:46,533 --> 00:02:49,500
Huh... We're finally rich, Ima!

70
00:02:49,533 --> 00:02:51,700
[SCREAMS] No more lonely nights

71
00:02:51,700 --> 00:02:53,467
- with no electricity!
- That's right!

72
00:02:53,467 --> 00:02:55,800
- Good bye, rent!
- Yes!

73
00:02:55,800 --> 00:02:58,567
- We can finally buy a house!
- Yes!

74
00:02:58,567 --> 00:03:00,167
[BOTH CHEERING]

75
00:03:00,167 --> 00:03:01,300
Yes!

76
00:03:01,300 --> 00:03:04,767
On the condition that you'll
marry Don Nato's godson.

77
00:03:06,533 --> 00:03:07,733
What?!

78
00:03:07,733 --> 00:03:09,167
[ZIA GIGGLING]

79
00:03:09,167 --> 00:03:16,167
[QUIRKY JAZZ MUSIC PLAYING]
